          "title": "Механика в деле",
          "phrase": "В твоей копилке 10 дней с упражнениями на тренажёре. У этой истории уже есть механический саундтрек.",
          "imagePrompt": "Premium glossy 3D achievement emblem, epic violet and magenta palette. One hero object: an oversized gym weight-stack selector pin with a thick rounded T-grip in translucent magenta glass, a polished violet metal shaft, and a compact coiled safety tether forming one clean arc. Displayed diagonally inside a chunky beveled double-layer shield frame with industrial enamel inlays. Middle tier of the same gym-mechanism series, deeper construction and more dimensional metalwork than the pulley tier. Tiny stars and sparks, saturated cinematic rim light, dark navy studio background, soft contact shadow, readable at 96px. No letters, numerals, inscriptions, logos, people, bodies, body parts, or user photos.",
          "fishMarkup": "[pleased]В твоей копилке <emphasis>10 дней</emphasis> с упражнениями на тренажёре. У этой истории уже есть механический саундтрек.",
