          "imagePrompt": "Premium glossy 3D achievement emblem, epic violet and magenta palette. One hero object: a compact stylized cable resistance machine with a broad violet metal arch, a translucent magenta weight-stack enclosure, and one integrated cable handle. Simplified chunky engineering, no settings or numerical scale. The machine stands within a monumental stepped shield frame of beveled metal and luminous glass inlays. Culminating tier of the cohesive gym-mechanism series, architectural and imposing while keeping one clear silhouette. Tiny stars and sparks, saturated cinematic rim light, dark navy studio background, soft contact shadow, readable at 96px. No letters, numerals, inscriptions, logos, people, bodies, body parts, or user photos.",
